      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Even if this was just an option in a player's menu, that would be great (if not an item).\n\nWould be nice to see the Creator Economy work in this way, right now it seems to mostly be catered to VRC groups and world stores, and not so much smaller performers yet",
